name mpostinl
category Package
revision 49559
shortdesc Embed MetaPost figures within LaTeX documents
relocated 1
longdesc This LaTeX2e package enables the embedding of MetaPost figures
longdesc within LaTeX documents. The package automatically collects the
longdesc embedded definitions and figures in a .mp file, adds an
longdesc appropriate LaTeX document structure, and compiles it to .mps
longdesc files. It also allows for various configuration options to
longdesc manage the generation of files and compilation.
runfiles size=5
 RELOC/tex/latex/mpostinl/mpostinl.sty
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/mpostinl
